<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CAPACITOR_DEBUG</key>
	<string>$(CAPACITOR_DEBUG)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>pt-BR</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>PetLife</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>pt-BR</string>
		<string>en</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>app.petlife</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>petlife</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>O PetLife usa a câmera para tirar fotos do seu pet — perfil, identificação de raça por IA e registros de saúde.</string>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>O PetLife pode acessar contatos apenas para você convidar familiares como co-tutores de um pet.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>O PetLife usa sua localização para registrar passeios em segundo plano, mostrar clínicas próximas e enviar alertas se um pet for marcado como perdido na sua região.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>O PetLife usa sua localização para mostrar clínicas próximas, registrar o trajeto dos passeios do seu pet e calcular distância/ritmo em tempo real.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>O PetLife salva carteirinha de vacinação e outros documentos na sua galeria.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>O PetLife usa a galeria para anexar fotos ao perfil do pet e documentos como carteirinha de vacinação.</string>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>remote-notification</string>
	</array>
	<key>UILaunchStoryboardName</key>
	<string>LaunchScreen</string>
	<key>UIMainStoryboardFile</key>
	<string>Main</string>
	<key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
	<array>
		<string>armv7</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIRequiresFullScreen</key>
	<false/>
	<key>UIStatusBarStyle</key>
	<string>UIStatusBarStyleDefault</string>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
